#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/xsoft/other/freerdp.xml:27
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>FreeRDP</application> package contains libraries and "
"utilities for utilizing the Remote Desktop Protocol. This includes tools to "
"run an RDP server as well as to connect to a computer using RDP. This is "
"primarily used for connecting to Microsoft Windows computers, but can also "
"be used on Linux and macOS."
msgstr ""

